# The paths whose change needs the operator's approval on GitHub
# (docs/adr/0035-agents-push-as-their-own-github-identity.md).
#
# The `code owners` ruleset on main requires a code owner's approval for any
# pull request that touches one of these. The operator is the only code owner;
# their own pull requests pass through that ruleset's admin bypass.
#
# The last matching pattern wins. Every line names the owner, so a later line
# never removes ownership by accident.

# Everything Argo CD applies to the cluster, both environments.
/platform/infra/                  @FilipeFantini

# CI, the checks it runs, and this file.
/.github/                         @FilipeFantini
/tools/                           @FilipeFantini

# Dependencies (installing a package runs its code). Unanchored: they match
# in every subproject.
pyproject.toml                    @FilipeFantini
uv.lock                           @FilipeFantini

# Configuration a lint, type or test tool reads, wherever it is put: a nested
# file takes precedence over the guarded one above it.
